e text message said. And it has been reviewed by certainly the paper down there in San Antonio, but the New York Times has taken a look at it and several other outlets and are reporting on it as if it is legitimate. But it said, quote, I had affair with our boss and I'm fine. That was it. That was all that was shared. But Rhodes, it's a big deal when we are hearing the words of a now dead woman who was seemingly confirming what had been reported and what had been rumored for so long."], [0, "Yes, and I think that part of the context was when she said, \"I had an affair with our boss and I'm fine,\" I believe she also added, \"You'll be fine too.\" The concern was that the two of them, when Gonz\u00e1lez would come, they were in the Uvalde office. When Gonz\u00e1lez would come to that part of the state, they would, they would be the envoys who would take him around, set up his meetings, be a part of it. All of a sudden, when, uh, Avil\u00e9s's husband let folks know that he knew his wife was having an affair, with the congressman, all of a sudden those visits stopped, those duties discontinued. And so it seemed as though she was reassuring the ex\u2014 this\u2014 the now former staffer, hey, we're going to be okay. Here's what happened. Basically, I had an affair with him. And so yeah, we just kind of have to lay low for a while. That's what the context was that I, um, read about that seemed to make a lot of sense why she was almost reassuring him. In that moment."], [3, "So the San Antonio Express-News, this is the paper that was first to report this, uh, this was also the paper that had endorsed him. So this paper, based on what they have seen, have\u2014 they have\u2014 they immediately\u2014 Robe said, nah, we are no longer in the Representative Tony Gonzales business and pulled an endorsement. Robe, he has an opponent down there, this is to be expected, but calling on him to resign, I don't know. Um, have you seen others. This is going to be talked about plenty, but I haven't seen other prominent names come out calling for his resignation yet."], [0, "No, we haven't actually\u2014 we haven't heard anything as of this recording from President Trump and specifically from Speaker Mike Johnson, who both, as you pointed out, President Trump in December publicly endorsed him. Mike Johnson has done the same as well. So a lot of folks are waiting to hear from one or both of them about their reaction to this because this primary is March 3rd, correct? So this is coming up and This is likely going to have a major impact on that if he doesn't drop out of the race ahead of time. But there's a Republican there, uh, in Texas who has called on him to resign. So there have been a couple of folks who have, and certainly that paper removing or rescinding their endorsement has a big impact on voters as well."], [3, "Big impact on voters could potentially have a big impact on Congress, right? These things now matter. This is the state that was redrawing lines to get more congressional seats, and this is one that should have been safe territory, and now they're going to target it. And look at this one as a possibility and opening all these\u2014 that's not the most important thing, clearly, but that is on the table. So with all this, what everybody is saying between a text message and a newspaper and an ex-staffer, what is the congressman himself saying? Well, two different things. There was something he said right after his staffer died, and then his tune certainly changed here recently. Stay here."], [0, "It's a new year and time to get back to feeling like yourself. If losing weight is one of your 2026 goals and you're ready to make progress you can count on, then Weight Loss by HERS might be the right fit for you. Through HERS, you're connected with a medical provider who determines if treatment is right for you. If prescribed, your treatment plan is personalized to support you in reaching your goals. Plus, you can access a range of treatment options like oral medication kits or GLP-1 injectables. Hers goes beyond medication by offering access to ongoing care, dosage and medication adjustments, lifestyle and nutrition tips, and 24/7 support with no hidden costs or membership fees. And with options starting at just $69 per month with a 10-month plan when paid up front in full, hers provides access to options that fit your goals and your budget. Feel like your best self again. Visit forhers.com/amy to get a personalized, affordable plan that gets you\u2014 that's f-o-r-h-e-r-s.com/amy. For hers.com/amy. Weight loss by hers is not available everywhere. Compounded drug products are not approved or evaluated for safety, effectiveness, or quality by the FDA. Prescription required. See website For full details, important safety information, and restrictions. Actual price depends on product and plan purchased."], [2, "This is Bowen Yang from Lost Culture Research with Matt Rogers and Bowen Yang. We all know the feeling when life gets really busy. Taking care of yourself can feel impossible. That's why Premier Protein shakes are my go-to. They have 30 grams of protein, 160 calories, no added sugar, and they taste amazing. So they're a healthy choice you'll actually want to make. It's not just for fitness, it's for getting after life. Premier Protein powers me to say yes to more. Find your favorite flavor at premierprotein.com. That's P-R-E-M-I-E-R protein.com."], [0, "Hey, this is US Olympic gold medalist"], [2, "Tara Davis Woodhall, and I'm US Paralympic"]], "participants": []}}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["politics", "congress", "election", "campaign", "scandal", "affair", "staffer", "suicide", "death investigation", "media reporting", "newspaper endorsement", "resignation", "texas", "public office", "ethics"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
