idays,"], [0, "and the realities of travel disruptions, shaping hard choices for those abroad. Underscoring the enduring connection many feel to the land. Thank you for tuning in to this Israel Today, ongoing war report update. I'm Noah Levi. Stay safe and informed. Keep in mind that this AI-generated report may contain occasional inaccuracies, so consult multiple sources for a comprehensive view. Find the code and more details in the podcast description."]], "participants": []}}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["israel", "war", "antisemitism", "protest", "policing", "toronto", "jewish community", "palestine", "zionism", "hate crime", "public safety", "venture capital", "artificial intelligence", "technology", "startups"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
{"timestamp": 1778565136.9280498, "duration_sec": 1.655806064605713, "validator_hotkey": "5FZe9Mpo5dLXfhGZ4VjRnw6dmz9LVPp6nzqPyDfaS9BLKs33", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "testnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "Yeah, I just did my third movie with Cowboy Cerrone, you know. We just finished a little over a week ago. Oh, that's\u2014 yeah, he's doing really good, man."], [1, "I love that."], [0, "Yeah, yeah, that's a guy that could."], [1, "Really legitimately transition to become a movie star."], [0, "Yes, yes. And he's got a lot more confidence. This is, like I said, the third movie I did. I did a\u2014 what he did, a Western with be. Outlaw Johnny Black, I wrote and directed it. But I had Cowboy, I had Randy Couture in it."], [1, "Oh wow."], [0, "And Josh Barnett."], [1, "Randy's done an amazing job of transitioning. Oh, absolutely. The Expendables, you know, and he's great at it. Yeah, yeah. He has a great personality, just very calm. Like he, well, I remember one time he was fighting Tim Sylvia for the heavyweight title and he came out there and he had a smile on his face. He looked over at me and he winked. I'm like, I was like, how is this motherfucker so relaxed before his fight? But he had an amazing perspective. He said to me, the people who love you will love you whether you win or lose. And he said, what's the worst thing that can happen? You lose? He goes, you've lost before. It's no big deal."], [0, "You remember him spanking Tito? Yeah, he got on top of him."], [1, "Spanking him when he had him down. Randy was an animal."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Comedy"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "in