{"timestamp": 1778572677.9372692, "duration_sec": 3.2927842140197754, "validator_hotkey": "5DkzbwTnocecNohGP4aNVcHZfUgx8uA1MGQ4WB1u3kfi78gE", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "mainnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "Major reports out this month say President Trump has damaged American democracy at remarkable speeds. They say he's pushed the U.S. closer to authoritarianism. NPR's Frank Langford has more on the consensus among the reports."], [0, "Brightline Watch, which surveys more than 500 U.S. scholars, finds that through tactics such as amassing executive power and attacking the media, Trump has pushed the U.S. system to a point nearly midway between liberal democracy and dictatorship. Dartmouth's Brendan Nyhan co-directs the survey. I would say the goal is to govern as an authoritarian."], [0, "Another report out by Sweden's VDEM Institute found America's democracy ranking plunged last year from 20th to 51st out of 179 countries, a sign that said that U.S. democracy is being dismantled at an unprecedented pace. The White House dismissed the findings, calling it, quote, a ridiculous claim made by an irrelevant, blatantly biased organization. Trump has repeatedly said he's no dictator. Frank Langford, NPR News, Washington."], [0, "A lot of March Madness brackets are already busted. 12th seed High Point University stunned Wisconsin yesterday in the first round of the NCAA men's college basketball tournament. High Point upset the Badgers 83-82. Guard Chase Johnston made a breakaway layup with 11 seconds left to win the game, his first two-pointer of the season. He's known for his three-point shooting."], [0, "This is High Point's first ever NCAA win. Fifth-seeded Wisconsin is now out of the tournament. I'm Kristen Wrigh